{
  "comment": "The cases of the interface contract that arm the fault injection points of the core, of http-negotiation and of template, whose error enums the core passes on (binding design G-5, X-1; HY-132.6), in the case form of binding (G-5). The group internal arms front_functions.route_request with the smallest application that routes the request GET / to its page; without the faults the request is the page home. The group template arms rules.template_reads with a template whose else-if branch the parser of template adds to its open block; without the faults the template has its read paths. A case of the group template without faults names a template that is missing and raises invalid_application, the other kind of rules.template_reads (HY-73.2). The group session arms session_store.session_waits for opening_functions.open_page with a file session of the directory / that found no record, whose first get starts the record session; without the faults the page opens with a new token. Its other cases give a memory store with a stored value of another form, or a mask that is no token, and raise the kinds of open_page that an input gives (HY-24.14, HY-104.23).",
